'''Wonders''' are rewards that grant a passive buff. They are usually obtained by clearing [[Main Quests|main quests]].

The Wonders screen can be accessed by going to ''Menu > Supplies > Wonders tab''. As of 1 Feb 2017, wonders can be manually toggled on and off here.

